So, try to figure out what
it is your passionate about,

00:37:19.364 --> 00:37:21.531
what it is that you enjoy,

00:37:22.913 --> 00:37:24.801
and you're going to
naturally become better,

00:37:24.801 --> 00:37:26.809
you're going to naturally endure the times

00:37:26.809 --> 00:37:28.828
of when it's hard because you love it.

00:37:28.828 --> 00:37:30.297
But the thing is, guys,

00:37:30.297 --> 00:37:33.571
you have to understand
that everybody up here,

00:37:33.571 --> 00:37:35.860
puts other people first.

00:37:35.860 --> 00:37:39.069
Everybody here teaches,
everybody here inspires.

00:37:39.069 --> 00:37:41.069
It's not about me, okay?

00:37:41.948 --> 00:37:43.124
That's why I see a lot of people

00:37:43.124 --> 00:37:45.659
getting off track 'cause
I get asked all the time

00:37:45.659 --> 00:37:48.134
and I've been asked a hundred times today.

00:37:48.134 --> 00:37:50.423
"I want to build this business
or want to build a following.

00:37:50.423 --> 00:37:52.462
"I want to do this, I want to do that."

00:37:52.462 --> 00:37:56.284
It's very simple, make it
about the other person,

00:37:56.284 --> 00:37:59.949
make it about what you can
give not what you take,

00:37:59.949 --> 00:38:02.029
and everything else takes care of itself.

